    "case_for": "I retain B001 as the strongest case for a fundamental, compact advance: exact fluctuation relations revealed a universal structure in nonequilibrium physics and gave irreversible processes a precise connection to equilibrium free-energy differences. The work has long since become standard across stochastic, molecular, and soft-matter physics, with broad theoretical development and experimental tests. Evans, Jarzynski, and Crooks represent complementary central formulations of this coherent achievement.",
